+# tally
+
+A small word counter, used as synthetic review material. Nothing here is real
+project code.
+
+## Use
+
+```sh
+python3 tally.py FILE
+```
+
+prints the number of words in `FILE`.
+
+## Before a push
+
+```sh
+./check.sh --selftest
+```
+
+runs the built-in cases in `check.sh` against `tally.py` and exits 0 when each
+one gives its expected count. It checks those cases only.
